				<svg role="img" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="browser-buttons"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M0 20a6 6 0 1 1 12 0 6 6 0 0 1-12 0Zm18 0a6 6 0 1 1 12 0 6 6 0 0 1-12 0Zm24-6a6 6 0 1 0 0 12 6 6 0 0 0 0-12Z" /></svg>
				<div class="site-icon-preview-tab">
					<img id="browser-icon-preview" src="https://vlandobrov.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/fast-forward.png" class="browser-icon-preview" alt="Browser icon preview: The current image has no alternative text. The file name is: fast-forward.png" />
					<div class="site-icon-preview-site-title" id="site-icon-preview-site-title" aria-hidden="true">Words &amp;&amp; Bytes</div>
						<svg role="img" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="close-button">
							<path d="M12 13.0607L15.7123 16.773L16.773 15.7123L13.0607 12L16.773 8.28772L15.7123 7.22706L12 10.9394L8.28771 7.22705L7.22705 8.28771L10.9394 12L7.22706 15.7123L8.28772 16.773L12 13.0607Z" />
						</svg>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<input type="hidden" name="site_icon" id="site_icon_hidden_field" value="42" />
	<div class="site-icon-action-buttons">
		<button type="button"
			id="choose-from-library-button"
			class="button"
			data-alt-classes="upload-button button-add-media button-add-site-icon"
			data-size="512"
			data-choose-text="Choose a Site Icon"
			data-update-text="Change Site Icon"
			data-update="Set as Site Icon"
			data-state="1"

		>
							Change Site Icon					</button>
		<button
			id="js-remove-site-icon"
			type="button"
			class="button button-secondary reset remove-site-icon"		>
			Remove Site Icon		</button>
	</div>

	<p class="description">
		The Site Icon is what you see in browser tabs, bookmark bars, and within the WordPress mobile apps. It should be square and at least <code>512 by 512</code> pixels.	</p>

</td>
</tr>

	
