<p class="description" id="timezone-description">
Choose either a city in the same timezone as you or a <abbr>UTC</abbr> (Coordinated Universal Time) time offset.</p>

<p class="timezone-info">
	<span id="utc-time">
	Universal time is <code>2025-10-18 22:52:22</code>.	</span>
	<span id="local-time">
	Local time is <code>2025-10-18 18:52:22</code>.	</span>
</p>

<p class="timezone-info">
<span>
	This timezone is currently in daylight saving time.	<br />
	 Standard time begins on: <code>November 2, 2025 1:00 am</code>.	</span>
</p>
</td>

